B.arS=new A.d2("aef-runtime-lab","AEF Runtime (LAB)","AEF Runtime (LAB)",B.lN,!1,!1,B.b0,null,B.ahZ,B.I,!1,"LAB apenas (IV-IVE-AEF-RUNTIME-INTEGRATION-01): caminho governado IVE \u2192 AEF com ferramentas MOCK, Human Gate e recibo persistido. N\xe3o implant\xe1vel; s\xf3 roda num stack Supabase local (AEF_RUNTIME_MODE=LAB, AEF_TOOLS=MOCK_ONLY). O cart\xe3o de aprova\xe7\xe3o no chat da IVE s\xf3 aparece com --dart-define=AEF_RUNTIME_LAB=true.","LAB only (IV-IVE-AEF-RUNTIME-INTEGRATION-01): governed IVE \u2192 AEF path with MOCK tools, Human Gate and a persisted receipt. Not deployable; runs only on a local Supabase stack (AEF_RUNTIME_MODE=LAB, AEF_TOOLS=MOCK_ONLY). The approval card in the IVE chat appears only with --dart-define=AEF_RUNTIME_LAB=true.","adminClickable=false: n\xe3o h\xe1 tela pr\xf3pria; a superf\xedcie LAB \xe9 o cart\xe3o no chat da IVE. Nenhuma ferramenta real, nenhum deploy.",null)
